$$PURPLE$$THE THRESHOLD$$FG$$
=================

Threshold is the pinned-style host window for THE TEMPLE OF HERMES.
Nous Girl is a fictional host from the Nous universe, not an official Nous
mascot.  New spoken host lines are marked NEW.

Run
---
  Cd("::/Hermes/Apps/Threshold");;
  #include "Run.HC";

Or compile once, then launch again:
  Cd("::/Hermes/Apps/Threshold");;
  #include "Load.HC";
  Threshold;

Agent hook
----------
  ThresholdStatus;

Writes ThresholdStatus.TXT next to the app.  The file contains the
MOTD, the pinned app list, the door list, the art paths, and simple
status.  No bitmap scraping is needed.

Keys
----
  S    view the cinematic toh-boot-splash.GR (one 640x480 GR at a time)
  1-5  show the listed door command
  ESC  return to the shell

Art
---
  Hermes/Art/Splash/toh-boot-splash.GR
  Hermes/Art/UI/pane-header.GR
  Hermes/Art/Icons/64/nous-girl.GR

The header-threshold-plate asset named in the brief is not present in
this worktree, so the existing pane-header plate is used unchanged.
